Always great fun doing interviews with 
@PaulHarrisGold
 at 
@KitcoMining


We discussed fiscal dominance, how miners should improve their marketing, the corporate gold standard etc.

Glad this time Paul did not call the #IGWT the „Playboy for Gold bugs“

Much of the copper narrative surrounds the demand side of the market. This isn't wrong, it just doesn't tell the full story.  This past weekend I presented 
@MetalsInvtForum
 and gave my thoughts on copper and gold.
